---
title: Standard 52-card deck
---

# Components {#components}

- 1x [[deck]] of 52 playing cards

# Glossary {#glossary}

Deck
: 52 playing cards: four [[suits]] of 13 cards, from ace to king.

Suit
: :coeur: hearts, :carreau: diamonds, :trefle: clubs or :pique: spades. Hearts and diamonds are red, clubs and spades are black.

Rank
: In order: ace, 2, 3… 10, jack, queen, king. Unless a game says otherwise, the ace is the lowest.

Face card
: A jack, a queen or a king.
